<title>JAPAN: Fuji Corp plans share split.</title>
<headline>Fuji Corp plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuji Corp Ltd said on Tuesday it planned a 1.15-for-1 share split on May 20, for shareholders as of March 31.</p>
</text>
